      "decision_index": 88,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Enchanting Dwynen's Elite (3/3 with Archdruid buff) with Presence of Gond means tapping a valuable attacker each turn for token generation. One of the 2/2 Elf Warrior tokens would be a better target since they contribute less to combat, and the tokens created are still Elves that get buffed by Elvish Archdruid.",
      "action_taken": "Chose Dwynen's Elite as the target for Presence of Gond",
      "better_line": "Enchant one of the Elf Warrior Tokens (2/2) with Presence of Gond, preserving Dwynen's Elite as an attacker while still generating Elf tokens that benefit from Archdruid's buff",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 132,
